-- # GOLD LAYER VIEW METADATA CATALOG
--This layer consist of dimension tables and fact tables for analysis and reporting for specific business metrics
-- ## Purpose
-- Structured metadata documentation for Gold layer analytical views.
-- This provide a  description about each column in each View 
-- from the Supply Chain Data Warehouse project.
--
-- ---



-- ## View: gold.dim_suppliers
--Provide description about suppliers and thier attributes
--
-- | Column Name   | Data Type     | Description                                      |
-- |---------------|---------------|--------------------------------------------------|
-- | supplier_key  | BIGINT        | Surrogate key for supplier dimension             |
-- | supplier_id   | NVARCHAR(20)  | Supplier business ID                             |
-- | supplier_name | NVARCHAR(50)  | Supplier company name                            |
-- | country       | NVARCHAR(50)  | Supplier country (e.g., Ghana, United States)   |
-- | ratings       | INT           | Supplier performance rating (e.g., 4, 5)        |
--
-- ---



-- ## View: gold.dim_returns
--Provide description about returns  and thier attributes
--
-- | Column Name | Data Type    | Description                                      |
-- |-------------|--------------|--------------------------------------------------|
-- | return_key  | BIGINT       | Surrogate key for returns dimension              |
-- | return_id   | NVARCHAR(20) | Return transaction ID                            |
-- | order_id    | NVARCHAR(20) | Related order ID                                 |
-- | return_date | DATE         | Return date (e.g., 2026-02-11)                  |
-- | reason      | NVARCHAR(50) | Return reason (e.g., Defective)                 |
--
-- ---



-- ## View: gold.inventory_movement
-- Provide description about inventory movement and thier attributes
-- | Column Name   | Data Type    | Description                                      |
-- |---------------|--------------|--------------------------------------------------|
-- | movement_key  | BIGINT       | Surrogate key for inventory movement             |
-- | movement_id   | NVARCHAR(20) | Inventory transaction ID                         |
-- | movement_type | NVARCHAR(50) | Stock movement type (e.g., IN, OUT)             |
-- | quantity      | INT          | Quantity moved                                   |
-- | movement_date | DATE         | Movement date (e.g., 2026-03-20)                |
--
-- ---



-- ## View: gold.fact_orders
-- Provide description about orders and thier attributes
--
-- | Column Name      | Data Type     | Description                                              |
-- |------------------|---------------|----------------------------------------------------------|
-- | order_id         | NVARCHAR(20)  | Unique sales order identifier                            |
-- | customer_id      | NVARCHAR(20)  | Customer business ID                                     |
-- | customer_name    | NVARCHAR(50)  | Customer name                                            |
-- | country          | NVARCHAR(50)  | Customer country (e.g., Ghana, United Kingdom)          |
-- | product_name     | NVARCHAR(50)  | Product purchased (e.g., Laptop, Keyboard)              |
-- | product_category | NVARCHAR(50)  | Product category (e.g., Electronics, Furniture)         |
-- | quantity         | INT           | Quantity sold                                            |
-- | unit_price       | INT           | Selling price per product                                |
-- | total_revenue    | INT           | Revenue generated                            |
-- | order_date       | DATE          | Order transaction date (e.g., 2026-04-05)               |
--

